<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Backseat</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Balu Brigada</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Portal</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7j6PWLaubVavCLE4peea8S</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.735" end="00:38.432">From the backseat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.432" end="00:42.229">Watch it roll by slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.229" end="00:47.946">Perfectly controlled</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.946" end="00:53.455">I'm on empty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.455" end="00:57.316">And my bloodshot eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.316" end="01:02.042">Are following the light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.042" end="01:04.684">So stay with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.684" end="01:08.431">I don't even like your company</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.431" end="01:12.272">I just wanted you to comfort me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.272" end="01:17.290">While I keep my eyes on the road</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.290" end="01:18.790">So take my picture</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.784" end="01:20.284">My picture, picture</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.168" end="01:22.560">You tell me I'm the one you wanted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.560" end="01:24.060">You really wanted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.952" end="01:26.396">But you don't love me like I love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.396" end="01:27.896">I don't believe you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.815" end="01:32.418">I take the keys and I'm gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.418" end="01:35.463">And when I'm driving, I'm really driving</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.463" end="01:37.821">I'm driving fast because I mean it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.821" end="01:39.321">I really mean it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.183" end="01:41.601">I think I'm done with all the speeches</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.601" end="01:43.101">Way from the bleachers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.070" end="01:46.679">Don't wanna hear 'em no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.679" end="01:48.938">Right from the backseat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.938" end="01:56.439">From the backseat, from the backseat, from the backseat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.439" end="02:04.439">From the backseat, from the backseat, from the backseat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.623" end="02:13.455">You see it all so clear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.455" end="02:18.434">You wanna take the wheel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.434" end="02:20.749">You stay with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.749" end="02:24.722">But you don't even like my company</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.722" end="02:28.466">I'll give you another soul to squeeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.466" end="02:33.460">While I keep my eyes on the road</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.460" end="02:34.960">So take my picture</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.941" end="02:36.441">My picture, picture</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.359" end="02:38.800">You tell me I'm the one you wanted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.800" end="02:40.300">You really wanted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.145" end="02:42.537">But you don't love me like I love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.537" end="02:44.037">I don't believe you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.948" end="02:48.676">I take the keys and I'm gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.676" end="02:51.671">And when I'm driving, I'm really driving</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.671" end="02:53.964">I'm driving fast because I mean it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.964" end="02:55.464">I really mean it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.311" end="02:57.769">I think I'm done with all the speeches</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.769" end="02:59.269">Way from the bleachers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.162" end="03:02.938">Don't wanna hear 'em no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.938" end="03:05.071">Right from the backseat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.071" end="03:12.750">From the backseat, from the backseat, from the backseat (From the backseat)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.750" end="03:20.339">From the backseat, from the backseat, from the backseat&amp;amp;nbsp;(Driving from the backseat)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.339" end="03:28.003">From the backseat, from the backseat, from the backseat (Driving from the backseat)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.003" end="03:32.003">From the backseat, from the backseat, from the backseat (Driving from the backseat</p></div></body></tt>